WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Guile uses raw Drive Rush toward the corner.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.450
Standing medium punch connects out of the Rush.

3
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.200
Back heavy links separately after the Rush medium.

4
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.250
Heavy-punch Hurricane launches Manon.

5
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:04.700
The HP version builds the juggle height.

6
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.150
The medium-punch version follows the launcher.

7
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:06.950
The second Super adds its juggle hits.

8
00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:07.350
Manon falls at the end of the two-Super route.
